            "Exemple  : {'Description': 'Q. What does abutment of the nerve root mean?', 'Patient': 'Hi doctor,I am just wondering what is abutting and abutment of the nerve root means in a back issue. Please explain. Wha', 'Doctor': 'Hi. I have gone through your query with diligence and would like you to know that I am here to help you. For further inf'}\n"
