            "i have a golfball-sized lump on/in my hamstring half way between knee and hip.  Next to it is a depression in the same muscle.  The mass seems to be involved in the hamstring muscle itself.  I did injure something a few weeks ago which causes deep aching inside the buttock where the muscle attaches to the hip bone structure.<|end|>\n",
